<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Digital Ghost</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Welcome to the Neighbourhood</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7lOZsUF1ff2mO1JHELAqhp</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.700" end="00:34.660">Got tired of all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.660" end="00:37.710">I'm bored of waiting for the world to end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.710" end="00:40.070">Make sure you tell the kids</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.070" end="00:42.830">'Cause you never know what sticks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.830" end="00:45.180">I'm here to be entertained</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.180" end="00:48.110">Steal my face and throw away my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.110" end="00:50.840">I never needed it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.840" end="00:53.120">You're all so welcoming</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.120" end="00:55.510">I looked up at the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.510" end="00:57.560">And felt my eyelids burn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.560" end="01:01.160">I'm getting numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.160" end="01:06.050">Bleed me into you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.050" end="01:09.910">Bleed me into you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.910" end="01:15.370">Digital ghost (digital ghost)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.370" end="01:21.020">Digital ghost (in the fold)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.020" end="01:26.090">You are the dust (you are the dust)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.090" end="01:34.090">You are the dust (in the bowl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.630" end="01:37.820">So darling, hold my hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.820" end="01:40.470">'Cause you and I are in demand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.470" end="01:42.990">Reality is such a bore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.990" end="01:45.700">'Cause no one has secrets left anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.700" end="01:48.110">Just love me 'til I'm numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.110" end="01:53.520">This coma is so beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.520" end="01:57.720">I'm so fucking beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.720" end="02:03.100">Digital ghost (digital ghost)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.100" end="02:08.590">Digital ghost (in the fold)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.590" end="02:13.660">You are the dust (you are the dust)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.660" end="02:21.660">You are the dust (in the bowl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.760" end="02:33.940">Sold god, so I made my own one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.940" end="02:39.220">Sold god, so I made my own one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.220" end="02:41.680">You're a stain that'll fade away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.680" end="02:44.210">You're the colour that fades to grey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.210" end="02:46.420">You're the voices that won't go away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.420" end="02:47.920">I'm more than a number</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.440" end="02:55.440">So let me forget about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.240" end="03:06.210">Digital ghost (digital ghost)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.210" end="03:10.750">Digital ghost (in the fold)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.750" end="03:13.280">You're a stain that'll fade away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.280" end="03:16.030">You're the colour that fades to grey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.030" end="03:17.960">You're the voices that won't go away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.960" end="03:19.460">I'm more than a number</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.350" end="03:22.990">So let me forget about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.990" end="03:26.990" /></div></body></tt>